==Strategy==
Martin doesn't have a [[Wave Attack]] like his alternate [[Kory]], but his attack power is greatly strengthened, and can easily take out spammed units especially on this level. Use units that have greater range, such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]] or [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Nerd Cat]], to quickly kill him.

For a speedrun, you can just use fast cats like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] and [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Lion Cat]] for {{1c}} as one hit from A. Bahamut ''almost'' knocks back Martin. For {{2c}}, you may need to bring down Martin's health by a great amount before sending out Awakened Bahamut.

